-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4f7753f-ef57-4715-927d-bd3e466e643e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-db4d4100-edfb-443a-89d3-26ea57e30354\"><b>✔️ 일시</b></span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fff85db7-efbb-44b5-9c9e-c7fd519b3c3b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b0209ff2-53c9-4d2f-8c90-edaf707f1659\">- 7/10(금) 16:40 ~ 19:00 경</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-48299ea7-8534-425a-aa12-99222b20458b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d66e9b89-f35c-4a3e-86d3-bc5fc535a659\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-03fcab4a-a4ed-4509-8df2-6539dfe33dac\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-1435c60c-9816-4bfb-b96a-8e34d8c1a06b\"><b>✔️ 내용</b></span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e5360cab-4273-468a-9bb0-535fe32f1b5e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d8669895-ac9a-4d07-a7ca-df063b3f1d70\">1. 일부 환경에서 마르차나 : 마린 스터디 라이브 월페이퍼의 특정 부위에 의도하지 않은 노이즈가 표시되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6e14a5b7-81a7-4b29-93d7-794c84efee08\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d866b3b2-3d66-44db-abaf-8f6f0f076c43\">2. 미니 게임 ISLAND BREAKER에서 200 Wave 이후 난이도를 하향 조정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-796cc63f-8062-4737-acba-312686e36fa8\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4de43f2e-21fa-42b3-802d-1bdcdb7e9260\">3. 마르차나 : 마린 스터디의 에피소드에 등장하는 라피 : 레드 후드 코스튬을 시나리오 설정에 맞게 조정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5760d77f-c9fb-4e56-91aa-0227f34bc1ae\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e1930fb1-2d65-42a2-b0c4-9ba83aa3c8a5\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-07d81c62-0170-4a00-a0da-42dbc59c0e76\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8efe7fd5-c04f-4ff7-bbce-567bb3642c27\">※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1b98f1e0-7403-497c-a9a4-4fa2b117db11\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-fddeb5de-87ad-41d0-930c-b8e75ee21750\">※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-21f6be6d-d428-4841-92ee-b6838d9e1ebe\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6698a641-2c24-47de-886f-6ed9cf5a5ad4\">·····················································································</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0b26a228-4856-4714-9f1c-bf4524e846d5\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8359b789-c293-4eef-9eaa-3aad36861155\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3c000348-521f-4bcc-8333-0cb461ebf14f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c91d06ba-cfe1-4357-a2d3-0d848e8da762\">게임 이용에 불